#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:36
msgid "Green Claims Phrase Check"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of variations checked, 2: number of variations the product has
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:57
#, php-format
msgid "Only the first %1$d of %2$d variations were checked."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:63
msgid "None of the checked phrases found. This check looks for a short list of phrases only and does not assess other environmental claims."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:69
msgid "Phrases to review:"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:78
msgid "A match is not a breach in itself. Point 4a does not apply when you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to the claim, or when the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium, such as the online selling interface (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825). Point 4c covers climate claims based on offsetting."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:87
msgid "EU harmonised notice and GARAN label (Article 6(1)(l) and (la) of Directive 2011/83/EU)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:91
msgid "Hide the notice (not a good)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:92
msgid "Hide the harmonised notice for this product, for example a digital download or a service: the notice covers goods. Article 6(1)(lb) of Directive 2011/83/EU requires a separate reminder for digital content and digital services, which Durabix does not show."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:97
msgid "Commercial Durability (Years)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:98
msgid "Only if the producer offers a commercial guarantee of durability at no extra cost for more than 2 years (e.g. 3, 5, 10). Values of 2 or less are not saved."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:106
msgid "Producer / Brand Name"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:107
msgid "Name of the producer offering the commercial guarantee of durability, as printed on the GARAN label. The label shows only when this and the years are filled in. Up to 40 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:114
msgid "Model identifier"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:115
msgid "Model identifier for which the producer offers the guarantee, as printed on the GARAN label. Empty uses the SKU. Up to 40 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:122
msgid "Repairability Class (A - E)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:123
msgid "Repairability class from the energy label of a smartphone or slate tablet under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/1669, from 20 June 2025. Article 1 excludes phones and tablets with a main display the user can roll up or unroll, and smartphones for high security communication. Leave it empty for every other product. Durabix shows the class as a badge, not in the official label format."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:126
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:31
msgid "Durabix EU Guarantees"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:32
msgid "EU Legal Guarantee"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:74
msgid "Durabix - EU Legal Guarantee & Durability Notices"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:76
msgid "The harmonised notice on the legal guarantee of conformity and the GARAN label for a producer guarantee of durability, as required by Article 6(1)(l) and (la) of Directive 2011/83/EU from 27 September 2026, in the official design of Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1960, plus a green claims phrase check (Annex I, points 4a and 4c, of Directive 2005/29/EC). The notice follows the site language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:83
msgid "Enable the notice and label"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:87
msgid "Display the harmonised notice, the GARAN label and the repairability class on product pages"
msgstr ""

