msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:118
msgid "Add the notice and the GARAN labels (as attached files) to the processing and on-hold order emails sent to the customer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:140
msgid "Complementary integration: Shoplex - EU Compliance for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:142
msgid "Shoplex adds other EU consumer law modules, such as the Omnibus lowest price and checkout disclosures."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:147
msgid "Shoplex is active."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:152
msgid "Explore Shoplex EU Compliance"
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:27
msgid "Banned when the neutral, reduced or positive greenhouse gas impact is based on offsetting emissions. Point 4c does not cover a claim based on the product's actual lifecycle impact (recital 12 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:33
msgid "A generic environmental claim is banned unless you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to it, or the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:39
msgid "A generic biodegradability claim is banned unless you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to it, or the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:45
msgid "Banned when the claim is based on offsetting emissions. Point 4c does not cover a claim based on the product's actual lifecycle impact (recital 12 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

